// Drowning you can hear and read: a mole held under water (a flooded pocket, no air) gasps and the log
// says to surface when its breath first runs short (BREATH_LOW, 35), and again when it's gone and the
// hurt begins. Once per crossing: the 35 line is said once, not every tick below it.
map
##############
#wwwwwwwwwwww#
#wwwwwwwwwwww#
#wwwwwwwwwwww#
#wwwwwwwwwwww#
#wwwwwwwwwwww#
#wwwwww@wwwww#
##############
end
set 1 breath 40
expect 1 ev:Gasp == 0
expect 80 breath < 35
expect 80 ev:Gasp == 1
expect 80 log:above_the_water == 1
set 100 breath 3
expect 160 breath == 0
expect 160 ev:Gasp == 2
expect 160 log:drowning == 1
expect 200 log:above_the_water == 1
expect 200 hp < 100
